{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "2eae8c959ad6c5d9f9c9dcf8adf952a54353699559a9624382bdb30e0093c85e", "ja": "またあえたね！", "zh": "又见面了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "16ae242501c964f9a875dba748082d529f40b5c590f5cd77982f7249871e1bc5", "ja": "太陽系で大人気の子ども向けバラエティ番組\n『☆ピコピコプラネット☆』が、特別番組に\nなって帰ってきた！　地球の自由研究のため\n再び地球に降り立ったミリオン星人たちが、\n特別映像でみんなを『せーふく』しちゃう！", "zh": "在太阳系大受欢迎的少儿综艺节目\n《☆Piko Piko Planet☆》化身特别节目\n强势归来！为了进行关于地球的自主研究，\n百万星人再次降临地球，\n将用特别影像把大家“征服”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_01_1000_035hin", "source_sha256": "8beeb8f7873ec87b72e3c1991670d4ac32ba51a2d988c316c2ccb3ccebf0a6c4", "ja": "銀河系の彼方にある星、ミリオン星……。", "zh": "位于银河系另一端的星球，百万行星……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_01_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "35f5dfbe0bdd20cf72768639608e5ab8f904bfda2c5b6c78a3312fae852cc287", "ja": "そこに住んでいるわたし達\nミリオン星人は、歌とダンスが大好き！", "zh": "居住在那里的我们这些百万星人，最喜欢唱歌跳舞了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_01_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "0b090b23b0dd0a87f6bd529fd55d2aa0aa7818ac9d74f3ef2759973ddf15577a", "ja": "ステージを見たみんなを\n『せんのー』して『せーふく』しちゃうんだ！", "zh": "百万星人会把看到表演的所有人\n都『洗脑』和『征服』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_01_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "6d63a43a171a8ae7b6fe860fdd98cbc61430f4cf96d774f3e7764db45a44a35b", "ja": "『せんのー』は、一緒に歌ったり踊ったりすること。\nそして『せーふく』は、お友達になること！", "zh": "“洗脑”就是一起唱歌跳舞。\n而“征服”就是成为朋友！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_01_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "6751501109e0b8a90e8badce7d9e73fa71a3cf739d0268ef8135341f44c1e263", "ja": "合言葉は？　せーの！", "zh": "暗号是？预备——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_01_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "8fa2d8cebb176d0c8dfa65b215c1b193ece282fe648762fb43d6a0f47378ddf7", "ja": "せんのー！　せーふく！　せんせーしょん！", "zh": "洗脑！征服！大骚动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_01_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "8fa2d8cebb176d0c8dfa65b215c1b193ece282fe648762fb43d6a0f47378ddf7", "ja": "せんのー！　せーふく！　せんせーしょん！", "zh": "洗脑！征服！大骚动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_01_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "8fa2d8cebb176d0c8dfa65b215c1b193ece282fe648762fb43d6a0f47378ddf7", "ja": "せんのー！　せーふく！　せんせーしょん！", "zh": "洗脑！征服！大骚动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_01_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "8fa2d8cebb176d0c8dfa65b215c1b193ece282fe648762fb43d6a0f47378ddf7", "ja": "せんのー！　せーふく！　せんせーしょん！", "zh": "洗脑！征服！大骚动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_01_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "c9ecb7deda29227bd4e72b46cae376307d1a5dde159d3319f24ab9f2c6d7d104", "ja": "というわけで『☆ピコピコプラネット☆』の\n特別番組なんです！", "zh": "所以，这是《☆噼啪星球☆》的特别节目！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_01_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "0421c7da96094bff57abde17fcbb3669b109f655d5aff7d508fd4f4a565ca366", "ja": "わーい！　ひさしぶりの地球だぞ～！\nみんな、元気にしてた？", "zh": "哇——！好久没来地球啦～！\n大家过得都好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_01_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "8288c30bb1b5ce20736a80a22eaace054a648e259cff0201de43ee6f194b2799", "ja": "でも、今度は宇宙船の故障じゃないよ。\nミリオン星の長いお休みだから、遊びにきたの！", "zh": "不过，这次可不是宇宙飞船故障哦。\n是因为百万星放了个长假，所以来玩啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_01_1012_035hin", "source_sha256": "1fdd4558d6dd2d314890be36fbaa0a94ac8729e51c79cd36b8f1fadd342ee39b", "ja": "地球のりんごがまた食べたくなっちゃってねぇ。", "zh": "因为我又想吃地球的苹果了呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_01_1013_040tam", "source_sha256": "ec01ddb2644a329ca9d29b9dff7083332e2df4783faf9aa37897c8c264749519", "ja": "コブンも、また地球のお友達と遊べるの、\nとっても楽しみにしてたんだ！", "zh": "小弟也一直很期待能再次和地球上的朋友们一起玩呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_01_1014_040tam", "source_sha256": "b3edcf188ad8b5ea5ab01c0c6dc3358eab33b9da929135a1d114d8ec5b3ead2e", "ja": "途中で寄り道した土星で、輪っかの\nドーナツ食べすぎて、今はお昼寝中だけど……。", "zh": "在中途绕道去土星的时候，吃了太多环状的甜甜圈，现在正在睡午觉……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_01_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "e28f6cf252af1bafedd42ccb75d2336b44ff254a87658d6c0cc0261b7729b99e", "ja": "地球で過ごしたときのこと、ミリオン星の\nみんなに話したら、みんなも興味があるみたいで。", "zh": "把在地球上生活时的事情告诉了百万星的\n大家之后，好像大家也都挺感兴趣的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_01_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "fe077995e2909b2258c66104e9d09cdbd767bf99040c32456ff49501369da150", "ja": "だから今度は、\n地球の自由研究をすることになったんだよ♪", "zh": "所以这次决定要做关于地球的自由研究啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_01_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "26274ebef902fe7f514c1974e516a1350ecc33b3445bbf66cb90044e38cab35a", "ja": "名付けて……地球百科事典！", "zh": "定名为……地球百科全书！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_01_1018_035hin", "source_sha256": "6bca6bbe4d590b3a29075e94bee073827f1d71d99495129c177879c510b879bc", "ja": "地球のいいところ、あたしたちが\nいろいろ探しちゃうよぉ！　楽しみだねぇ。", "zh": "地球的好地方，就由我们\n来多多发掘吧～！好期待呀～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_01_1019_024ann", "source_sha256": "241e9e7342ae7791c64edc5d742ed1ab6457ba14a291a1f5fd85f5aceb919810", "ja": "おもしろいもの、おいしいもの……いーっぱい！\nビビッと見つけちゃいます♪　イェイ！", "zh": "有趣的东西、美味的东西……好多好多！\n我们会一下子发现它们的♪ 耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_01_1020_022ser", "source_sha256": "6858bcfc5c1cdce4e16a45c0ed90976d439fa63d340ad4b4694d59c85301652b", "ja": "地球のいい子のみんなにも、自由研究、\n手伝って欲しいな♪　よろしくお願いしますっ。", "zh": "希望地球上的乖孩子们，也能来帮忙做\n自由研究呢♪　拜托大家啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_01_1021_024ann", "source_sha256": "4e3872cbf4951397ee6c5764e81e18addcf3ae02356ee69d20ea42fbdf1bcaa6", "ja": "それとね！　杏奈達のことをまだよく知らない\nみんなのために、今日は特別映像があるの！", "zh": "还有哦！为了让还不太了解杏奈她们的大家，今天准备了特别影像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_01_1022_040tam", "source_sha256": "3b4f698cf06a4ea22f40324cfd6d4803a3ef6a19ceaa8a7b29b5219973ae9fcd", "ja": "この映像を見たら、みんなも『せーふく』完了！\nたまきたちの友達だぞ～、くふふ♪", "zh": "看完这段影像，大家也就完成“征服”啦！\n成为环的朋友吧～，咕呼呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_01_1023_035hin", "source_sha256": "2e5c7b41de90e7b37d676eb6dda8736c32078b3ccf997c1e959723c6e94ea218", "ja": "それでは、VTR～……", "zh": "那么，录像——……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_01_1024_022ser", "source_sha256": "c609c8ba7d0a82c9c418d8ab8cabef88b010b5ed2a7d6ff3eed28fdb4c09c0cb", "ja": "スタート～！", "zh": "开始～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
